__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}});const n={privacy:"This policy explains what AngelOS stores and why, in everyday language.\n\n## Who this covers\n\nAngelOS is a tool for a beauty studio and its students. It covers the person who signs in, and the clients whose details that person chooses to save.\n\n## What is saved\n\n- Your sign-in email and password, kept by our sign-in provider.\n- Studio details you type in: clients, bookings, notes, photos, messages, posts and Academy work.\n- A record of which connected apps you turn on, such as Instagram, Facebook or LINE.\n\nWe use this only to run AngelOS for you. We do not sell it, and we do not use it for advertising.\n\n## Who else sees it\n\nOnly the services that keep the app running: hosting, the sign-in service, the AI assistant when you ask it something, Apple if you use a subscription, and Instagram, Facebook or LINE if you connect them.\n\nYour clients' details belong to you. Please only add photos, health notes or contact details when the client has agreed.\n\n## The assistant\n\nThe assistant drafts words for you. It does not send a message, post or booking change until you approve it. It is not medical advice.\n\n## Deleting your account\n\nYou can delete your account and the business data stored with it at any time: Profile \u203a Account \u203a Delete account.\n\nIf you pay through the App Store, cancel that subscription in your iPhone Settings. Deleting the account does not cancel an Apple subscription by itself.\n\n## Your choices\n\nYou can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you. Japanese privacy law applies to this app.",terms:"These terms are the agreement for using the AngelOS app. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to them and to the Privacy policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.\n\n## What the app does\n\nAngelOS helps a beauty studio keep clients, bookings and a calendar, learn in the Academy, and draft messages and posts with an assistant. Some connections, such as LINE, Instagram and Facebook, only work after you connect your own account. Features can change while the app is in testing.\n\n## Your account\n\nYou are responsible for the email and password on the account, and for what you save about your clients. Do not share the account. Students only see the Academy areas their studio allows.\n\n## Messages, posts and photos\n\nNothing is sent to a client, or posted to a social account, until you approve it. You confirm you have the right to use the photos and words you upload, and that clients have agreed where that is needed.\n\n## The assistant\n\nDrafts from the assistant can be wrong. Read them before you approve. The assistant is not a doctor, lawyer or accountant.\n\n## Plans\n\nWhile the app is in testing, paid plans may be unavailable. If a subscription is billed by Apple, it renews until you cancel it in iPhone Settings. Deleting your AngelOS account does not cancel that subscription.\n\n## Stopping use\n\nYou can stop using AngelOS at any time and delete the account from Profile \u203a Account \u203a Delete account. We may suspend an account that is used to break the law or to harm someone else.\n\n## Liability\n\nThe app is provided as it is, while it is still being built. We are not responsible for lost bookings, lost messages or decisions you make from a draft.",summary:"1. AngelOS stores your sign-in details and the client, booking, note, photo and Academy data you enter.\n2. We use that data only to run the app. We do not sell it or use it for ads.\n3. You own your clients' data. The assistant only drafts, and it is not medical advice.\n4. You can delete your account and data at any time from Profile \u203a Account \u203a Delete account. An Apple subscription must be cancelled in iPhone Settings.\n5. Japanese privacy law applies. You can ask to see, correct or delete your data."}},1161,[]);
